(2, 'Borgmesterens Tårn', 'The grand tower of the city mayor, overlooking the kingdom from its highest spire. Features a spiral staircase, treasure room, and a rotating top floor.', 399, 'Festninger og borger', 'https://placehold.co/400x300/4a4e69/white?text=Borgmesterens+T%C3%A5rn', 100, 412, 8),
