(4, 'Drakeborgfestningen', 'A legendary dragon-themed fortress with sweeping battlements and a fire-breathing dragon statue at its gate. Includes a catapult, dungeon cell, and four minifigures.', 699, 'Festninger og borger', 'https://placehold.co/400x300/4a4e69/white?text=Drakeborg', 100, 834, 9),
(5, 'Kongens Ridderborg', 'The royal castle of the noble king, surrounded by tall stone walls and flying banners. Features a throne room, armory, stable, and six minifigures including the king and queen.', 899, 'Festninger og borger', 'https://placehold.co/400x300/4a4e69/white?text=Kongens+Borg', 100, 1092, 9),
