(7, 'Drakejegernes Festning', 'An imposing fortress built by the legendary dragon hunters to protect the realm. Features multiple towers, a great hall, siege weapons, and eight detailed minifigures.', 1399, 'Festninger og borger', 'https://placehold.co/400x300/4a4e69/white?text=Drakejegerne', 100, 1845, 10),
(8, 'Isrikets Slott', 'A magnificent ice castle ruled by an ancient snow queen. Built from translucent blue bricks, it features a frozen throne room, ice bridge, and magical prison tower.', 1699, 'Festninger og borger', 'https://placehold.co/400x300/4a4e69/white?text=Isrikets+Slott', 100, 2234, 12),
