-- Romfart og galakser (IDs 11-20)
(11, 'Månebisen Alfa', 'A small but powerful lunar rover designed to explore the surface of the moon. Easy to build and perfect for young space explorers, includes one astronaut minifigure.', 149, 'Romfart og galakser', 'https://placehold.co/400x300/1a1a2e/white?text=M%C3%A5nebisen+Alfa', 100, 148, 6),
(12, 'Romstasjonen Sirius', 'A modular space station orbiting a distant planet. Features a command module, science lab, solar panels, and a docking bay with escape pod.', 299, 'Romfart og galakser', 'https://placehold.co/400x300/1a1a2e/white?text=Romstasjonen', 100, 312, 7),
(13, 'Galakseskipet Polaris', 'A sleek interstellar cruiser built for long voyages through the cosmos. Includes folding wings, hyperdrive engine, crew quarters, and two pilot minifigures.', 499, 'Romfart og galakser', 'https://placehold.co/400x300/1a1a2e/white?text=Polaris', 100, 567, 8),
(14, 'Asteroidebasen Kappa', 'A mining base carved into a massive asteroid, harvesting rare crystals from the rock. Features drilling machinery, storage vaults, cargo shuttle, and four worker minifigures.', 699, 'Romfart og galakser', 'https://placehold.co/400x300/1a1a2e/white?text=Asteroidebase', 100, 823, 9),
(15, 'Stjerneskytteren X-7', 'A lightning-fast fighter craft designed for space combat and interplanetary patrol missions. Has rotating laser cannons, cockpit ejector seat, and detailed wing mechanics.', 899, 'Romfart og galakser', 'https://placehold.co/400x300/1a1a2e/white?text=Stjerneskytteren', 100, 1023, 9),
(16, 'Orions Romfartøy', 'A massive exploration vessel sent to the edge of the known universe. Features multiple decks, a xenobiology lab, holographic bridge, and six crew minifigures.', 1099, 'Romfart og galakser', 'https://placehold.co/400x300/1a1a2e/white?text=Orion', 100, 1356, 10),
(17, 'Planetforskeren Nebula', 'A scientific research ship studying newly discovered planets on the galaxy''s rim. Includes detachable planetary lander, research drones, and eight scientist minifigures.', 1399, 'Romfart og galakser', 'https://placehold.co/400x300/1a1a2e/white?text=Nebula', 100, 1734, 10),
(18, 'Galaksestasjonen Orion-7', 'A colossal deep-space station serving as a hub for interplanetary travel and trade. Features a rotating habitat ring, docking ports for five ships, and ten minifigures.', 1699, 'Romfart og galakser', 'https://placehold.co/400x300/1a1a2e/white?text=Orion-7', 100, 2187, 12),
(19, 'Svart Hull Utforskeren', 'A reinforced science vessel built to study phenomena near black holes. Has shielded hull panels that open to reveal research instruments and a gravity measurement array.', 1999, 'Romfart og galakser', 'https://placehold.co/400x300/1a1a2e/white?text=Svart+Hull', 100, 2645, 12),
(20, 'Galaksekeiserens Fartøy', 'The legendary flagship of the Galactic Emperor — a colossal warship bristling with weapons and housing an entire space armada within its hangar bays.', 2999, 'Romfart og galakser', 'https://placehold.co/400x300/1a1a2e/white?text=Keiserens+Fart%C3%B8y', 100, 4123, 14),

-- Hav og undervannsverdener (IDs 21-30)
(21, 'Dypdykkers Mini-Base', 'A tiny underwater research station perfect for beginner ocean explorers. Includes a small submarine, two divers, and a treasure chest with golden pieces.', 179, 'Hav og undervannsverdener', 'https://placehold.co/400x300/0077b6/white?text=Dypdykker', 100, 198, 6),
(22, 'Korallrevets Utpost', 'A colorful outpost nestled among coral reefs, home to marine scientists studying ocean life. Features a moonpool for divers, specimen tanks, and three minifigures.', 299, 'Hav og undervannsverdener', 'https://placehold.co/400x300/0077b6/white?text=Korallrevet', 100, 334, 7),
(23, 'Havbunnens Skattekiste', 'An ancient sunken ship resting on the ocean floor, filled with undiscovered treasures. Includes a shipwreck hull, diving bell, treasure trove, and ghost pirate minifigure.', 449, 'Hav og undervannsverdener', 'https://placehold.co/400x300/0077b6/white?text=Skattekiste', 100, 487, 8),
(24, 'Blekksprutkongens Borg', 'The underwater fortress of the mighty Kraken King, guarded by giant mechanical tentacles. Features a throne of coral, creature stables, and four sea warrior minifigures.', 649, 'Hav og undervannsverdener', 'https://placehold.co/400x300/0077b6/white?text=Blekksprutkong', 100, 745, 9),
(25, 'Havfruens Grotte', 'A magical underwater grotto where mermaids gather to sing and keep their secrets. Built with translucent bricks to represent crystal-clear water, includes mermaid figures.', 799, 'Hav og undervannsverdener', 'https://placehold.co/400x300/0077b6/white?text=Havfruens+Grotte', 100, 934, 8),
(26, 'Undervannsstasjonen Delta', 'A high-tech underwater research station studying deep ocean ecosystems. Modular design allows multiple configurations, includes submarine dock and five researcher minifigures.', 999, 'Hav og undervannsverdener', 'https://placehold.co/400x300/0077b6/white?text=Stasjon+Delta', 100, 1234, 10),
(27, 'Sjøhestens Palass', 'The grand palace of the noble Sea-Horse King, built from shells and sea glass. Features a coral throne room, garden of anemones, and royal guard of seahorse knights.', 1199, 'Hav og undervannsverdener', 'https://placehold.co/400x300/0077b6/white?text=Sj%C3%B8hestens+Palass', 100, 1567, 10),
(28, 'Atlantis Ekspedisjonen', 'The legendary lost city of Atlantis, finally discovered by a team of brave explorers. Massive set featuring sunken temples, ancient machinery, and twelve expedition minifigures.', 1499, 'Hav og undervannsverdener', 'https://placehold.co/400x300/0077b6/white?text=Atlantis', 100, 1945, 12),
(29, 'Dyphavets Hemmeligheter', 'A research mission to the deepest ocean trench uncovers alien-like creatures and luminescent landscapes. Features bioluminescent elements and deep-sea submersible craft.', 1699, 'Hav og undervannsverdener', 'https://placehold.co/400x300/0077b6/white?text=Dyphavet', 100, 2234, 12),
