(38, 'Alvedronningens Borg', 'The grand forest castle of the Elven Queen, grown from living wood and adorned with flowers. Features a great tree-trunk throne room, hanging gardens, and eight royal elf minifigures.', 1299, 'Skog og naturmagi', 'https://placehold.co/400x300/2d6a4f/white?text=Alvedronning', 100, 1678, 10),
